In[37]:= FFT[dat];

All variants were reviewed during the class

Chapter 3



All this data was taken from Anastasia' s nb

In[161]:= spec = <|MaxTime -> 10, SampleRate -> 100, 
   Components -> {<|Amplitude -> 2, Frequency -> 20, TStart -> 1, 
      TEnd -> 10|>, <|Amplitude -> 3, Frequency -> 32, TStart -> 3, 
      TEnd -> 6|>, <|Amplitude -> 1, Frequency -> 6, TStart -> 2, 
      TEnd -> 5|>, <|Amplitude -> 2, Frequency -> 55, TStart -> 1, 
      TEnd -> 10|>}|>;

data = Table[{t, 
    Total@Map[
      If[#[TStart] <= t <= #[TEnd], 1, 0]*#[Amplitude]*
        Sin[2 Pi t #[Frequency]] &, spec[Components]]}, {t, 0, spec[MaxTime], 
    1/spec[SampleRate]}];

ListLinePlot[data, PlotRange -> All, AxesLabel -> {"Time (s)", "Amplitude"}, 
 PlotLabel -> "Сигнал с компонентами в заданных интервалах", 
 ImageSize -> Large]


